  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.19 - Qwen-Image Edit 2511 checked against ComfyUI's own runs (ComfyUI's qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed: reference pictures modulated at t = 0, switched on by the file's marker). StreamedModelWeights reads ComfyUI's mixed-precision fp8mixed safetensors (per-layer scales, quantization metadata checked: anything not computed exactly is refused). Fix: 8-bit streamed weights now run on WebGPU / WebGL / Wasm (a synchronous Synchronize() is gone). Tests load the large demo models from models.spawndev.com, so a fresh clone runs them. See CHANGELOG.md.",
